WEBVTT

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:04.350
New life of Soleil.

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:08.980
In celebration of your birth, 
I grant you the royal blessing.

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:11.540
Ciel Langford.

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:15.400
May your future be one of joy and prosperity.

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:27.240
If you'll excuse me.

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:36.230
Ciel, huh?

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:38.070
That's such a great name!

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:39.530
Dad's so smart!

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:47.650
Thank you for coming to the celebration 
personally, Princess Yuki.

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:51.400
Izana would have been so pleased...

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:53.400
Elisa...

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:56.190
Don't cry, Mom!

00:00:56.190 --> 00:00:58.410
We gotta be strong until the war's over!

00:00:58.610 --> 00:01:01.750
'Cause Dad's being strong in Hariant, too!

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:03.960
Right, Ciel?

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:06.370
That's right.

00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:09.370
Well, if you'll excuse us...

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.630
Miss Layla... Have I been 
wrong all this time?

00:01:18.590 --> 00:01:21.070
I didn't want anyone else to die...

00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:23.910
But because of me... 
they just seem to keep...

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:29.360
Lord Izana gave his life to 
bring you important information.

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:33.200
Your royal integrity demands that 
you respect that determination.

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:35.400
I know.

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:38.520
I know that, but...

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:47.920
Enemy garrison is beginning to withdraw.

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:50.120
Pursue.

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:53.660
Don't let one of them get back to 
Hariant alive. Annihilate them.

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:57.780
But they've been completely demoralized...

00:01:57.780 --> 00:02:00.190
I repeat: Annihilate them.

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:05.180
I know it conflicts with 
Princess Yuki's policies.

00:02:05.740 --> 00:02:07.560
I'll take responsibility.

00:02:09.470 --> 00:02:10.480
Yes, sir.

00:02:10.820 --> 00:02:11.810
Annihilate them!

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:21.070
<i>Izana, I heard the warning you 
gave your life to send me.</i>

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:22.620
<i>But...</i>

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:33.530
<i>This is the response I've chosen.</i>

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:50.180
The Price of Smiles

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:50.180
<i>The Price of Smiles</i>

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:10.390
<b><i>The Elegy of Dawn</i></b>

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:07.950
So we took back the State of Theras, eh?

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:12.980
Scared the hell out of me when their chief 
of staff led the invasion personally, but...

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:17.410
Well done. Keep the pressure 
on them, would you?

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:20.300
How goes the increased 
production of the new chrars?

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:21.670
We're going as fast as we can.

00:04:21.670 --> 00:04:22.990
On top of that, I have good news.

00:04:23.890 --> 00:04:28.140
We've discovered that improving 
the placement of the new chrars

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:31.000
allows for far better output than before.

00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:33.880
Using this in mobile artillery

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:36.790
would allow us to shell them from
 greater distances than ever before.

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:38.000
Excellent!

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:41.770
We'll blast those Imperial squatters 
right out of our palace!

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:45.910
The weapon will primarily 
serve as a show of force.

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:50.070
We're long past the point where powerful 
artillery alone can win us the day.

00:04:51.340 --> 00:04:53.710
But if used prudently,

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:56.760
this could perhaps turn the 
tide back in our favor.

00:04:56.760 --> 00:05:00.300
If that would indeed end the war,

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:02.050
I would welcome it...

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:06.960
But only if it doesn't cause 
unnecessary deaths on their side.

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:11.910
Princess Yuki, have you forgotten 
what happened the other day?

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:16.210
The Empire set an ambush 
for our withdrawing forces

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:18.060
and attacked them mercilessly.

00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:21.420
As a result, the deaths 
were solely on our side.

00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:25.740
"Treasure all lives, whether friend or foe."

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:28.150
It's a beautiful ideal, in principle.

00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:30.930
But it's not realistic.

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:33.750
War cannot be whitewashed so easily.

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:36.720
I will not argue with you in that regard.

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:40.080
But the new chrars are another story.

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:43.330
Those assembled should be familiar by now

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:45.870
with the contents of the data Izana sent us.

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:49.350
Yet you continue to manufacture new chrars—

00:05:49.350 --> 00:05:50.320
We do.

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:53.080
We have no other choice.

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:00.960
I don't believe it.

00:06:01.390 --> 00:06:04.710
How could they ever face Izana after this?

00:06:05.120 --> 00:06:08.360
According to the research data 
the Empire was concealing,

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:11.520
the scientists of the Empire of 
Verde had independently realized

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:14.720
the chrars' negative impact 
on the environment.

00:06:15.740 --> 00:06:17.980
It would happen over the course 
of a millennium or two...

00:06:18.630 --> 00:06:22.690
But if we kept using chrars, the planet's soil 
would eventually turn barren.

00:06:23.930 --> 00:06:26.720
The Empire of Verde perceived the new chrars,

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:30.090
which would hasten that 
process, as dangerous.

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:34.780
That perception eventually led to the 
terrorist act of twelve years ago.

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:37.870
Do you think Mother and Father knew?

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:42.730
I suspect that Verde first 
tried amicably to inform

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:45.650
both sides about the danger of the chrars.

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:50.760
But the information never 
reached the royal couple.

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:53.510
Somebody smothered it.

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:56.610
Them, most likely.

00:06:57.700 --> 00:07:00.810
Grandiga also suppressed the information.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:03.080
The Empire of Verde fell,

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:06.920
and the survivors perpetrated 
that act of terrorism,

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:10.860
killing the royal couple, 
and many others, in the process...

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:16.370
Miss Layla... did you lose... 
someone important to you, then?

00:07:18.190 --> 00:07:19.620
I just had a feeling...

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:22.690
But I couldn't ask before now...

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:25.630
I guess you don't want to tell me about it...

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:27.970
Princess Yuki...

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:33.410
<i>And so, Miss Layla told me everything.</i>

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:37.430
<i>How she was caught up in the 
same incident my parents were,</i>

00:07:37.610 --> 00:07:39.180
<i>and lost everything...</i>

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:42.270
<i>How she didn't feel like 
returning to the Empire...</i>

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:46.290
<i>and with Izana's help, started a new life...</i>

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:51.010
Princess Yuki, I have a favor to ask you.

00:07:52.650 --> 00:07:55.340
As a former chrars researcher,

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:58.830
there is something about the information 
Lord Izana left us that concerns me.

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:01.450
Could I have time to analyze it?

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:03.420
Yes. Please do.

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:09.040
<i>The Royal Army mass-produced the new chrars,</i>

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:11.590
<i>and managed to keep the 
Imperial Army at bay...</i>

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:15.000
<i>The war fell into a stalemate again.</i>

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:18.510
<i>Casualties between the two 
armies exceeded 300,000.</i>

00:08:28.460 --> 00:08:29.940
<i>Winter will come soon...</i>

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:34.750
<i>What will happen to these children 
if we can't get enough food?</i>

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:42.960
<i>Then one day, as autumn neared its end...</i>

00:08:43.720 --> 00:08:45.960
It is now about 90% complete.

00:08:46.850 --> 00:08:49.600
The Excessarca is expected to 
collect the parts tomorrow morning

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:51.460
to carry them to the front line.

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:54.570
What brings you here today?

00:08:54.570 --> 00:08:58.000
Could I use one of the new 
chrars test facilities?

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.630
I only require an hour.

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:01.320
If you wish.

00:09:01.320 --> 00:09:03.470
Thank you. Let's go.

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:06.340
Wait a minute.

00:09:06.340 --> 00:09:07.810
I'll show you the way.

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:14.190
What's in there?

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:16.130
You'll see soon enough.

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:36.210
Miss Layla, what are those?

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:41.470
Microscopic mechanisms found 
in our planet's atmosphere.

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:43.260
Ancient nanomachines.

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:48.400
The data Lord Izana sent 
allowed me to identify them.

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:52.300
It's my first time seeing 
them this way, as well, but...

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:55.530
These nanomachines were released

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:59.160
by our ancestors to terraform the planet.

00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:02.330
These self-replicating nanomachines 
dissolved into the atmosphere,

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:03.910
became part of its composition,

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:07.160
and rendered the planet 
capable of sustaining life.

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:10.870
But as generations passed from 
the initial immigration,

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:13.690
the knowledge and technology were lost.

00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:19.350
In time, something unexpected happened...

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:23.260
A mineral unique to this planet,
 the chrarslapis, was discovered.

00:10:24.260 --> 00:10:28.330
This revolutionary mineral provided 
limitless clean energy...

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:33.060
But the idea of something coming 
from nothing is pure fantasy.

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:35.570
They should have questioned 
it from the start.

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:40.650
By coincidence, the chrars had a natural 
resonance with the nanomachines.

00:10:41.210 --> 00:10:44.270
The energy that seemed to 
be produced by the chrars

00:10:44.270 --> 00:10:46.960
was actually the energy that 
powered the nanomachines,

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:49.330
extracted through that resonance.

00:10:50.490 --> 00:10:55.170
In effect, the chrars are 
draining the nanomachines.

00:10:56.090 --> 00:11:00.590
With continued usage, as you can see, 
the nanomachines begin to die out...

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:03.610
...And the planet's environment degrades.

00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:07.350
You're saying the Empire 
of Verde realized that?

00:11:10.470 --> 00:11:11.770
Miss Layla!

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:12.890
I'm almost finished.

00:11:12.890 --> 00:11:15.490
Try not to look directly at the light.

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:24.370
Do not worry.

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:26.620
The experiment was a success.

00:11:27.780 --> 00:11:32.000
Continuous overburdening of a new chrars

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:35.480
shut down its resonance 
with the nanomachines.

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:38.310
Are you saying...

00:11:38.310 --> 00:11:43.630
Yes. The chrars lost its ability to 
channel energy from the nanomachines.

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:46.360
The result is all around you.

00:11:46.360 --> 00:11:47.390
I see...

00:11:48.230 --> 00:11:51.380
It would be impossible to keep 
fighting under such circumstances.

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:55.310
It's the greatest weapon I've ever seen.

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:57.900
If we turned this on the Imperial Army,

00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:00.780
the Kingdom could end the war victorious!

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:08.920
90% of our energy supply has been disrupted.

00:12:08.920 --> 00:12:11.370
The security system remains down, as well.

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:13.950
Maintain maximum vigilance 
with the naked eye.

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:17.400
Let me know the moment the 
Excessarca is in sight.

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:18.130
Yes, sir.

00:12:18.860 --> 00:12:21.380
Uncertainty is spreading among the staff.

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:24.130
It's late in the season, 
and we'll need ways to keep warm...

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:26.060
Distribute emergency rations.

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:28.640
Camping will be permitted within 
200 meters of the facility.

00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:32.640
Tell the heads of each department 
to keep a firm hand on their staff.

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:39.520
Miss Layla, how long will 
things be like this?

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:42.010
I believe power will be restored by dawn.

00:12:42.410 --> 00:12:43.650
Forgive me.

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:46.410
I didn't expect it to 
affect such a wide area...

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:52.410
My simulations had it limited 
to ten meters of the experi—

00:12:58.450 --> 00:12:58.960
Ouch!

00:13:00.990 --> 00:13:02.970
<i>What was that sound she just made?</i>

00:13:04.870 --> 00:13:06.580
Not used to keeping a fire?

00:13:07.230 --> 00:13:08.970
Another lifelong city dweller, I see...

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:10.450
I'll take over.

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:12.470
Camping's something I can handle.

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:17.480
It's getting colder...

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:21.250
You've really done it to us this time.

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:24.640
The fire is going out.

00:13:29.630 --> 00:13:30.620
It's nice and warm...

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:33.370
Maybe...

00:13:33.930 --> 00:13:39.130
if we could all live together 
like this... war wouldn't even...

00:13:39.530 --> 00:13:44.960
According to the records, our ancestors 
did live like this, long ago.

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:50.270
Our home planet did not have chrars,

00:13:50.630 --> 00:13:53.190
and before civilization developed,

00:13:53.190 --> 00:13:56.140
they must have spent a long time 
living just such simple lives.

00:13:57.020 --> 00:13:58.580
Then, you think we could—

00:13:58.580 --> 00:14:00.310
It's a fantasy.

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:01.650
Harold?

00:14:02.560 --> 00:14:06.770
The loss of chrars would lead to a 
scramble for resources just to survive.

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:09.910
If we didn't have weapons, we'd just 
kill each other with our bare hands.

00:14:10.140 --> 00:14:11.600
B-But...

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:14.050
Don't you remember the research 
from the Empire of Verde?

00:14:14.050 --> 00:14:16.040
If we keep using the new chrars...

00:14:16.310 --> 00:14:18.470
The immediate danger must 
be dealt with first.

00:14:18.470 --> 00:14:21.670
If we fail to win this war, 
the Kingdom will fall.

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:24.560
Your beloved people will die out.

00:14:26.190 --> 00:14:28.150
But if we use this against the enemy,

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:29.540
it could prove extremely useful.

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:31.300
I'm sorry to inform you,

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:34.240
but it cannot be used as a weapon.

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:37.920
Neither we nor the Empire have the technology

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:41.060
to make the phenomenon occur 
in a given location at will.

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:45.080
I'm very sorry to disappoint you.

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:49.970
All right, I get the gist.

00:14:49.970 --> 00:14:52.030
Try to keep the princess warm.

00:14:52.560 --> 00:14:53.840
Yes, sir.

00:15:01.390 --> 00:15:03.710
It really is a fantasy...

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:05.020
But...

00:15:05.680 --> 00:15:08.120
If not for these things, Izana...

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:12.480
You and she might never 
have lost your lives...

00:15:14.280 --> 00:15:15.900
Losing and taking...

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:19.480
Is that cycle all there is, in the end?

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:21.860
In terms of what I can do...

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:32.900
I heard everything.

00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:34.950
Quite a mess you had to 
deal with yesterday, eh?

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:38.710
Izana left you one hell of a souvenir.

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:39.960
Yes...

00:15:41.680 --> 00:15:44.550
What happened with Izana 
isn't solely your fault.

00:15:44.550 --> 00:15:46.400
You shouldn't beat yourself up too much.

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:48.830
We can't afford to lose 
any more of our people.

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:51.970
That's quite a tone to take 
with your Grand Master.

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:53.730
I feel the same way.

00:15:53.730 --> 00:15:56.240
When did that boy I watched sweat 
bullets in his first deployment

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:58.950
start talking like he's a real man?

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:06.600
I'm told the Excessarca 
will set out this evening.

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:09.550
It's going to be carrying the new artillery.

00:16:09.550 --> 00:16:10.490
I see...

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:14.620
Miss Layla, I want to ask you something.

00:16:17.190 --> 00:16:18.610
That's all of it.

00:16:19.070 --> 00:16:20.050
We're counting on you.

00:16:25.740 --> 00:16:26.860
That's the end of it.

00:16:26.860 --> 00:16:29.060
It's only a matter of time 
before the Imperial Army

00:16:29.060 --> 00:16:30.880
breaks the defense line and arrives here.

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:32.680
How goes the loading of the mobile artillery?

00:16:32.680 --> 00:16:34.460
Ten minutes to completion.

00:16:36.440 --> 00:16:39.010
The moment it's done, 
head for State Capital Edinell.

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:41.240
Take Princess Yuki and get out of here.

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:46.580
Retrieve all the chrars research 
materials from the facility.

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:49.810
Get as many of the workers 
on board as you can, as well.

00:16:49.810 --> 00:16:52.860
Out of the Order machines, 
the Monocherous Unit alone will remain.

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:56.290
I'll take command and buy 
time for you to escape.

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:58.410
Understood. And the twins?

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:00.220
I'm leaving them to guard the ship.

00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:00.970
You can't...

00:17:00.970 --> 00:17:03.120
Master! Allow us to join you!

00:17:04.090 --> 00:17:06.320
You'll keep Princess Yuki safe.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:08.050
That's an order.

00:17:09.940 --> 00:17:12.130
No! You need to come with us!

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:15.210
Your life comes first, Your Highness.

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:24.840
Harold!

00:17:30.390 --> 00:17:32.480
Don't look at me that way.

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:35.090
You need to be stronger than this.

00:17:35.090 --> 00:17:36.360
But...

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:38.910
We can't afford to stand still now.

00:17:39.220 --> 00:17:42.660
The Empire won't be able to maintain 
this war of attrition much longer.

00:17:43.010 --> 00:17:44.840
They'll be struggling to end things quickly.

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:51.690
Princess Yuki, I apologize for the 
many times I've disobeyed you.

00:17:51.690 --> 00:17:57.330
It was the only way I knew 
to protect the Kingdom.

00:17:59.330 --> 00:18:04.540
Princess Yuki, if you truly care 
about your country and your people,

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:06.830
the time has come for you to make choices,

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:09.440
no matter how difficult 
and painful they may be.

00:18:09.930 --> 00:18:14.060
As their leader, you do not 
have time to stand still.

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:17.570
Walk forward, I ask you.

00:18:23.180 --> 00:18:24.700
Harold...

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:30.880
I will hold the road behind you.

00:18:57.270 --> 00:18:58.400
<i>Traps activated!</i>

00:18:59.390 --> 00:19:01.820
I think we might just buy them a little time.

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:02.410
<i>Yes, sir.</i>

00:19:02.590 --> 00:19:06.120
<i>Let's go out there, guns blazing, 
and hold their attention.</i>

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:08.280
I'm sorry to make you join me here.

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:09.420
<i>Not at all.</i>

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:12.680
<i>Any knight would be honored 
to serve as rear guard.</i>

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:13.920
Indeed.

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:18.640
Report from field recon.

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:19.680
Hostilities have begun!

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:21.290
Have they noticed us?

00:19:21.290 --> 00:19:22.680
Not yet.

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:31.740
<i>They've breached the mine field!</i>

00:19:31.740 --> 00:19:33.020
They'll cut through!

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:33.940
Follow me!

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:37.570
New life of Soleil.

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:39.570
In celebration of your birth,

00:19:40.180 --> 00:19:44.450
I grant you the royal blessing.

00:20:24.980 --> 00:20:26.280
The one from last time, eh?

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:39.670
Now, give her your blessing.

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:43.890
Princess Yuki Soleil...

00:20:53.390 --> 00:20:58.330
May your future be one of joy and prosperity.

00:21:22.860 --> 00:21:24.620
Report from recon.

00:21:24.620 --> 00:21:26.340
Hostilities have ended.

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:28.480
No signs of the enemy in the area.

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:30.850
We'll reach a safe distance soon.

00:21:32.190 --> 00:21:33.600
Grand Master Harold...

00:21:48.500 --> 00:21:49.860
Full speed ahead.

00:21:50.420 --> 00:21:52.410
We don't have time to stand still.

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:55.000
Take us to State Capital Edinell!

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:40.390
<b><i>The Ignition of Souls</i></b>
